QuikGraphWeb is a JavaScript adaptation of QuikGraph.
Upstream: https://github.com/KeRNeLith/QuikGraph
Source commit: 9cd6b49292e09041258708a37bed99c56177b0ef

QuikGraph originated as QuickGraph by Jonathan "Peli" de Halleux (2003),
continued as YC.QuickGraph, and is maintained as QuikGraph by KeRNeLith
and the upstream contributors. The original source, tests, and this
adaptation are distributed under the Microsoft Public License (MS-PL).
See LICENSE for the full terms. Original attribution and license notices
are retained in the reference test archive.

This is an independent web port. JavaScript runtime adaptations and
verified behavior differences are documented in docs/compatibility.md.
